[2689]="7004E74B\n1\tDespeja la entrada de los túneles de arañas\tDespeja la entrada de los túneles de arañas.\n2\tAsegura el camino que conduce a Colmilludo\tAsegura el camino que conduce a Colmilludo.\n3\tEncuentra y derrota a Colmilludo Fauces Hediondas\tEncuentra y derrota a Colmilludo Fauces Hediondas.\n",
[2690]="7004E74D\n1\tDespeja la entrada de los Túneles de las Arañas\tDespeja la entrada de los Túneles de las Arañas.\n2\tAsegura el camino que conduce a Colmilludo\tAsegura el camino que conduce a Colmilludo.\n3\tEncuentra y derrota a Colmilludo Fauces Hediondas\tEncuentra y derrota a Colmilludo Fauces Hediondas.\n",
[2691]="7000D4E3\n1\tConsigue bastones Angmarim (total: 5)\tLos sacerdotes y sacerdotisas de Angmar se encuentran cerca de los altares en los Bails, o asentamientos, de Himbar, que se encuentra al oeste de Gath Forthnír. Maerchiniath te ha pedido que derrotes a los sacerdotes de Angmar y le traigas sus bastones como prueba de tu éxito.\n2\tLleva las bastones a Maerchiniath, en Gath Forthnír\tGath Forthnír está al este de Himbar. Ve a ver a Maerchiniath con los bastones que arrebataste a los sacerdotes de Angmar.\n",
[2692]="7000D6B5\n1\tDerrota Hombres demacrados en Imlad Balchorth (total: 5)\tLos Hombres demacrados se encuentran en el oeste de en Imlad Balchorth, al oeste de Valleoscuro. Sigar te ha pedido que destruyas a los Hombres demacrados de Imlad Balchorth.\n2\tHabla con Sigar\tSigar está en Valleoscuro, al este de Imlad Balchorth. Tras matar a los Hombres demacrados como se te pidió, vuelve a ver a Sigar en Valleoscuro y cuéntale que la tarea está completada.\n",
[2693]="7001570D\n1\tHabla con Gúthi\tGúthi se encuentra en el Cruce de las Cenizas, en el oeste de las Profundidades Llameantes. Deberías hablar con Gúthi cuando estés listo para viajar a la antigua forja de Hurmulkezer.\n2\tHabla con Gúthi en el Cruce de las Cenizas\tGúthi se encuentra en el Cruce de las Cenizas, en el oeste de las Profundidades Llameantes. Se alegrará de saber que Dolpan no pudo terminar de forjar su arma en la antigua forja.\n",
[2694]="70035669\n1\tViaja al Laberinto de Setos en los Campos de los Caballos de las Tierras de Bree\tPara celebrar la primavera, los residentes de las Tierras de Bree han construido un impresionante Laberinto de Setos. Viajeros de todas partes se acercan para intentar recorrer el laberinto, beber y divertirse. Viaja a los Campos de los Caballos en las Tierras de Bree para unirte a las festividades. ¡[según el diario] al Festival de Primavera!\n2\tViaja al Laberinto de Setos en las Tierras de Bree para participar en la celebración de primavera\tCada año, toda la Tierra Media celebra el fin del invierno con un alegre Festival de Primavera. ¡Dirígete al Laberinto de Setos, organizado por los hombres de las Tierras de Bree, para empezar a participar en las festividades!\n",
[2695]="70071E90\n1\tReach Esteemed standing with the Hamât Renewed\tAs Hamât rises anew, you have proven an invaluable ally. Mizâdi and her agents look to you for further assistance. You should return to Mizâdi's encampment and treat with Lumgâna.\n2\tSpeak to Lumgâna at Mizâdi's encampment\tAs Hamât rises anew, you have proven an invaluable ally. Mizâdi and her agents look to you for further assistance. You should return to Mizâdi's encampment and treat with Lumgâna.\n",
[2696]="70072AFF\n1\tSpeak with Dabâr at Ahâba\tDabâr warns that his tale is one of caution and offers it as reward for rescuing him, and the other from the gaol. Speak with him near the bridge in the north of Ahâba.\n2\tSpeak with Dabâr in Ahâba\tDabâr paused. You should ask him to continue his tale. You can find him near the bridge on the northern side of Ahâba.\n3\tSpeak with Dabâr to hear the remainder of his story\tDabâr paused again, conscious of the eyes upon him. He beckoned you closer to finish his tale. You should speak with him near the bridge on the north side of Ahâba.\n",
[2697]="70072B00\n1\tSpeak with Malgâras at Ahâba\tMalgâras bids you stay and listen to him. Speak with him beneath the canopy east of the stable-master in Ahâba.\n2\tSpeak with Malgâras\tMalgâras appears finished, a smile spreading on his face. Speak with him again beneath the canopy near the stable-master in Ahâba.\n",
[2698]="70072AFE\n1\tSpeak with Vilgêra at Ahâba\tVilgêra wishes to share a tale as a reward for helping to release him. Speak with him beneath the canopy near the sheep pen in Ahâba.\n2\tSpeak with Vilgêras in Ahâba\tVilgêras stops, his voice growing hoarse. He asked you to step closer to hear the remainder of the tale. He awaits you near the sheep pen in Ahâba.\n",
[2699]="700375B8\n1\tTalk to Reeve Fríthild\tReeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. Thane Ordlac asked if you would broach the subject of a feast in celebration of the victory at Bardh-dorám with Reeve Fríthild.\n2\tTalk to Reeve Fríthild to join the feast\tReeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should speak with Reeve Fríthild to join the feast.\n3\tTalk to Thane Ordlac\tThane Ordlac is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should speak with Thane Ordlac regarding the treachery at the feast.\n",
[2700]="70028C94\n1\tAbre las jaulas (total: 3)\tHay jaulas de prisioneros en Brôntrig, al este de la torre donde se oculta Answith. Answith te ha pedido que entres en Brôntrig y liberes a todos los cautivos que encuentres allí.\n2\tHabla con Answith en el Valle del Isen\tAnswith está acampado en la torre, al oeste de Brôntrig. Debes regresar junto a Answith e informarle de tu victoria.\n",
[2701]="70066063\n1\tPick up the crate of tonics\tEliaril has asked you to bring a crate of tonics to the Calembel barracks. The crate is in a small hamlet, outside of the city.\n2\tBring the crate to Maeron\tEliaril has asked you to bring a crate of tonics to Maeron. Maeron is in the Calembel barracks.\n3\tMaeron has asked you to distribute tonics to wounded soldiers in the Calembel barracks.\t\n4\tReturn to Maeron\tYou should let Maeron know that have brought healing potions to many of the wounded soldiers in the barracks. Maeron is in the Calembel barracks.\n",
